{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14148","headline":"江城秋霁 · 戎昱","name":"江城秋霁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霁後江城风景凉，岂堪登眺只堪伤。\n远天螮蝀收残雨，映水鸬鷀近夕阳。\n万事无成空过日，十年多难不还乡。\n不知何处销兹恨，转觉愁随夜夜长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}